1
00:00:00,042 --> 00:00:01,995
will AI replace UX research?

2
00:00:01,995 --> 00:00:04,145
AI tools are already doing a lot of the slow

3
00:00:04,145 --> 00:00:05,645
work they can transcribe interviews

4
00:00:05,645 --> 00:00:07,385
they can summarise hours of notes

5
00:00:07,436 --> 00:00:09,895
it saves UX researchers a lot of time

6
00:00:09,955 --> 00:00:12,145
I cannot even imagine having to do my thesis

7
00:00:12,145 --> 00:00:13,225
four years ago

8
00:00:13,225 --> 00:00:14,665
I probably would do it, but oh my God, it

9
00:00:14,665 --> 00:00:15,895
would be a lot of work

10
00:00:15,905 --> 00:00:17,891
so AI is changing how UX research gets done,

11
00:00:17,891 --> 00:00:19,933
in a good way, I think, if you use it well
